    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## AI Check & Improve\r\n\r\n**Use AI Chat as a Design Partner only after you've drafted your persona and problem statement in Sketch Lab.**\r\n\r\n1. Provide your draft persona details and your problem statement.\r\n2. Ask AI to check for clarity:\r\n   - Is it specific?\r\n   - Is it user-centered?\r\n   - Is it focused on a **need** (not a solution)?\r\n3. Ask AI for a couple stronger versions of your problem statement, then pick one and edit it in your own words.\r\n4. Ask AI to spot what's missing or assumed (ex: sterotypes, fairness, accessibility, unrealistic details).\r\n5. Update your final persona and problem statement back in Sketch Lab.\r\n\r\n**Reminder:** AI is a helper, not the author. Your final work should still sound like you.\r\n\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
